Subject: [PATCH] fix: accept glitch-topstep-v9 prompt version from Hermes
 profile 0.1.31

Bump GLITCH_TOPSTEP_PROMPT_VERSION to glitch-topstep-v9 so intents from
the paired Hermes profile (GTHP-028 / prompt v9) pass gateway validation.

Without this pairing, every delivery receipt fails with
intent_schema_invalid / prompt_version_mismatch even for valid NOTHING.

Update test fixtures and acceptance scripts to the paired prompt contract.

Pairing: glitch-topstep-hermes-profile v0.1.31 / PR #83
